      "value": "@{5a7ac88bf5a5c52c08064fb9|full_name}: because favouritism among people... You should look more into how people behave on social platforms when their presentation is nicer as to how people engage with one another.. You might think its small thing but wait for the backlash. As the gap between non + and regular grows.. so will the user devide.. I'm not buying the \"promise\" of only small cosmetics from a company who rolled this out so quickly.\nthey havent completed things \"planned\" since 2017 like user volume control which is a pretty big deal (users playing music over mic) I'm sorry but that just means my trust isnt very high.\nI'll bite for a month but im extremely skeptical our money is going to actually show results.. no roadmap announcement or clear plan on how much users will affect the teams size and progress.. literally no transparency.\nThere was also no word of making the price 5 bucks a month.. literally no response.. the constant word I hear \"but discord\".. yet discord has a 5 bucks classic that most users went for including myself.\nFor less or the same I can get amazon prime which comes with prime video, twitch prime... or even netflix.. a giaaaant library of movies.. or even gamepass.. a giant library of games.. or spotify for my entire family would i pay 5 bucks more.. Just saying: the cost doesn't add up.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
