      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a015331a6fd0876a51d5148|full_name}: Thank you for the more detailed reply. This is what I was after really. \nNot after defending VRChat, that's their own job. But people need to be more up about why they think things are bad or good.\nI am also well aware of how people behave socially on platforms, and you can't really blame it on VRChat either. Us people are stupid and follow trends like there is no tomorrow.\nAlso agree that I think VRChat should also be more upfront about their progress and plans. And every time a communiy update post is made, I get a bit more disappointed on not seeing anything else than jobs and \"we are working on it\"",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
